      "vault_field_ignored:oauth_token — the googledrive vault type stores both service_account_json (optional) and oauth_token (optional). This connector reads service_account_json ONLY; a credential that carries just oauth_token will fail at call time with a missing-credential error.",
      "requires_service_account_json: the vault marks it optional, so the connector must be given one. Domain-wide delegation or explicit file sharing to the service account's address is needed for it to see any files."
